  <diagram id="hoang-w3-2" name="03 PTO-7 Q1 Q7 va Review Tuan 3">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1500" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="840" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2" value="PTO-7 (Q1, Q7) &amp; Phản biện kỹ thuật W3-G01 / W3-I01 / W3-I02" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=26;fontColor=#18283F;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="45" y="20" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" value="Nguyễn Văn Hoàng (20233413) | Giải thích giới hạn NUM=8 (max_inflight=2) và cơ chế an toàn vùng nhớ DMA khi kill/exit" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#18283F;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="45" y="62" width="1400" height="32" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" value="PTO-7 / Q1: Commit chuẩn xv6 &amp; Toolchain&#10;• .xv6-commit = f780d7850765d74cbdcd1fff4b822d8829f7c9bd&#10;• Có sẵn sleep_prepare() trong kernel/proc.c&#10;• Harness hỗ trợ tự động unknown-elf &amp; linux-gnu&#10;• Trạng thái: Giữ nguyên trong Tuần 3 (PENDING GVHD)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#E9F0FF;strokeColor=#315EAB;fontColor=#18283F;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="45" y="125" width="680" height="185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" value="PTO-7 / Q7: Virtqueue NUM=8 và max_inflight = 2&#10;• Mỗi request cần 3 descriptor: Header(16B) + Data(1024B) + Status(1B)&#10;• Với NUM = 8: floor(8 / 3) = 2 chuỗi INFLIGHT đồng thời (dư 2 desc lẻ)&#10;• Khi 4 producer phát 16 request: 2 INFLIGHT + 14 QUEUED trong io_queue&#10;• Đủ độ sâu hàng đợi để phân biệt rõ FIFO và SCAN (PENDING GVHD)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#E7F4EF;strokeColor=#26775A;fontColor=#18283F;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="775" y="125" width="680" height="185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
